OL,3,GNEWSA'Slippery leaves' to blame for
OL,4,Atrain cancellations
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, 22 services running
OL,7,Fbetween Scarborough, Bridlington and
OL,8,FHull were affected, with trains not
OL,9,Fstopping at Cottingham, Beverley or
OL,10,FDriffield. Passengers travelling
OL,11,Fbetween Hull and Halifax were also told
OL,12,F18 services would stop at Bradford due
OL,13,Fto "slippery rails".
